@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Client" as Client
participant "SmartCartView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "SmartCartAlgoService\n(Backend)" as Algo
participant "ScoringService\n(Backend)" as Score
participant "ProductRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Client -> UI : Input preferences, budget, quantities & click Calculate
UI -> Algo : calculateSmartCart(preferences, budget, quantities)
activate Algo

Algo -> DB : findAll()
activate DB
DB --> Algo : return all inventory products
deactivate DB

Algo -> Score : calculateScores(preferences, productTags)
activate Score
Note over Score: Match user preferences\nwith dynamic product tags
Score --> Algo : return compatibility scores
deactivate Score

Note over Algo: Execute 3D Knapsack algorithm\nto optimize total score within limits

Algo --> UI : return optimized clothing package
deactivate Algo

UI -> Client : Render recommended smart cart items
@enduml